WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Count the passes. That instruction sounds simple—until something unexpected crosses the screen.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a famous experiment, many watchers did not report the surprising visitor.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
But a later study changed the speed of the surprise—and detection changed too.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Attention is selective, but it is not a permanent closed door.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That is a finding about particular experiments, not proof of a focus-audio cure.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the sources. Try the free audit. Ask better questions before paying.
